# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Lemma 2.4.A.A: uniqueness of alpha via polynomial monotonicity
# Lemma 2.4.A.B: Banach contraction mapping for alpha
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Lemma A: P(alpha) := (A-B)*alpha - V_cone*alpha^5 - 1 = 0 — the equation of
