# THEOREM 2.7.P.2 (Universal Cone Correction)
# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# For any constant C with tree-level (or loop-level) Trinity formula C_tri,
# the exact value differs by a quantized correction:
#     C_exact = C_tri * (1 + Z * alpha^n * V_cone^m)
